            </note>
            <note corresp="#d591-f2" n="38" xml:id="d591-f2-content">
                <p>John Soukine, Acting Minister of Foreign Affairs in the Kolchak government,
                    Omsk.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d591-f3" n="39" xml:id="d591-f3-content">
                <p>Maj. Gen. William S. Graves, commanding the American forces in Siberia.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
